[{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"砌上埋黄叶，云中挥白毫。\n落瓶珠萼细，笼树玉山高。\n未暇裁寒练，何曾失宝刀。\n飘零愁背日，回照莫成劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45190,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"枯涸逢人少，荒茫失路多。\n泥涂铺纻练，珠玉委江河。\n染亦因风力，光疑入镜魔。\n无心信芳洁，寥落夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45191,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"严飙随远近，须到野人家。\n拂岫迷青黛，回江走白沙。\n瀌沨投阔直，迂曲入欹斜。\n巧拙无藏处，空山对落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45192,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"一宵星月落，万户暗扶桑。\n凤阁浮香粉，华山起白羊。\n路岐增浩叹，云合漫飞扬。\n琐散成朝暮，河山空瀁洸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45193,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"阆风连夜发，绥飒到平明。\n狡兽云间毙，飞禽海上惊。\n寒威驱雾翳，霁色带霜清。\n庵里复何事，危襟坐五更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45194,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"错落空中映，萧疏象外泠。\n溪清不可见，云暗欲全醒。\n坐对无昏昼，行吟过户庭。\n烟深孤鹤影，寂莫拟身形。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45195,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"万顷看同缟，凭云降复升。\n到江知是水，近日不成冰。\n花落疑春妒，光流向夕澄。\n江寒人欲暮，皓皓自千层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45196,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"素质轻如羽，悠悠经暮秋。\n投窗空见影，积石暗闻流。\n拟作琼瑶迹，翻怜溟渤沤。\n连天捲山雾，迢望转成愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45197,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"千株开照曜，一夜满庭阴。\n拟㨖云霄上，宁愁溟壑深。\n夏凌堪镇岳，春水欲鸣琴。\n漭沆思林泽，鱼龙未易寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45198,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"浩渺成高厚，冰壶秋水涵。\n藓苔低见覆，梅李侧多惭。\n去雁迷烟渚，饥乌啄草庵。\n繁丝停暮色，须发入寒潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45199,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"玉尘连朔漠，飞堕水中盐。\n万灶无烟火，千峰入素缣。\n树寒莺语怯，石冻梨花淹。\n倒照云中色，晶晶对夕檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45200,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"一天冥海岳，万岫失松杉。\n极目空中素，回头人倚岩。\n压沈云外路，微溅石边函。\n渺渺开襟处，春融见远缄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45201,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"阴阳凝散碧烟中，飘落何劳问异同。\n飞絮随风空自白，寒炉终夜为谁红。\n深山拥被怜东郭，野店凭鞍笑谢公。\n冻杀亦饶清气在，人间天上一无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45202,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"凭轩迢望欲携筇，濯濯江山千里从。\n白尽不曾誇素色，晴来犹自覆青松。\n暖消石室一杯茗，寒入峰林几夜钟。\n试问重裘驴背上，护生堤畔肯从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45203,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"纷纷裂素映山窗，万壑千岩色尽降。\n转雾惊风朝不避，轻云蔽月夜无双。\n爱同野鹤投高树，不畏飘蓬入大江。\n一种萦光随去住，枉教人自对寒缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45204,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"永夜沈沈闻折枝，空山如在百重围。\n佛灯初暗纸窗白，香篆将残磨衲知。\n十里江楼寒吹蚤，孤舟沙岸苦吟迟。\n因兹忆起平生事，万虑消停鬓已丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45205,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"天南漠北雨霏霏，谁掩峰头明月扉。\n秖为萦空惭夕照，却怜落树似花飞。\n板桥风捲马蹄滑，江树云繁驿路微。\n看到晴峦春渐去，乡关何处待人归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45206,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"寂寞何人映读书，穷檐衣薄逼年除。\n几多阳艳寒中过，岂有光华霁后舒。\n撒空未许随风尽，含影还堪儗月初。\n回首莫愁云路隔，白茫茫处是吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45207,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"蔼蔼浮浮散五湖，寒庭孤屿惜骊珠。\n傍岩妃子元名宓，仗节孤臣本姓苏。\n澹若肌肤疑玉粲，皓然须发蘸冰壶。\n飘飖更有回风处，浅渚荒原照碧芦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45208,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"河梁匹马晚凄凄，奕奕浮光拂树低。\n驿舍官梅花溅路，酒楼衰柳客如泥。\n云连古岸沈牛迹，影隔千峰无鸟啼。\n空濛上下知何极，谷口闻钟野寺迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45209,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"霏微暮色锁清斋，久住峰头路不埋。\n愧倚晨曦光自满，更嫌晚彩影谁谐。\n龙泉暗溜千行石，牛火频烧品字柴。\n寒彻始知魂梦隔，何人吟望在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45210,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"同云遍野朔风催，万顷晴光一夕回。\n惨憺莫愁寒日处，通胧只在暝烟堆。\n坐久不禁成独往，夜深常觉有人来。\n春明未必能相似，谁遣繁花寂寞开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45211,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"积照微茫绝四邻，望中谁是陌头人。\n落花满院疑无树，拂草连天暗度春。\n一室冰棱应自惜，万峰珠错岂全贫。\n分明共对羲轩上，更待晴晖恐未真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45212,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"寒风超忽白纷纷，两岸琼崖一水分。\n昼里合离难著素，空中兴灭不成文。\n影沈池上千重玉，光覆楼头六出云。\n便向歌筵分酒力，容华销尽到斜曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45213,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"万树梨花暗寺门，愁云冉冉滴寒原。\n今年到地未盈尺，几日遮天长似昏。\n近水无声空入涧，远峰不见却闻猿。\n凄清共是此时节，犹忆匡山五里村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45214,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"苍茫江雾湿征冠，万井萧条行路难。\n黄竹有歌愁宋玉，荜门无路卧袁安。\n梅逐馀香须早落，羽惭轻质不胜寒。\n云中信有凝春树，向日微微出石栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45215,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"散漫川原自雪山，龙沙迢递雁门关。\n千林玉树三春失，万顷琼田一钁閒。\n银象难藏身外影，素娥不耐月中颜。\n谁云埋没河山上，指点楼台落照间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45216,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"幽静多怀对远天，飘零犹自忆前年。\n洁清亦许随芳秽，流乱何从数后先。\n几家依树笼芳月，一雁迷烟下暮田。\n已觉光芒疑梦里，泠泠石涧水流边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45217,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二箫","author":"释函是","text":"衡阳委绝白迢迢，衰柳荒原朔气骄。\n自有流光迟曙色，却无形影到春潮。\n萦回古渡愁归客，萧索空山泣去樵。\n风景依稀还世外，人间何事苦招摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45218,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"缤纷繁鹜没空郊，独向层峰伴鹤巢。\n活水满煎三峡茗，断松斜压一间茅。\n龙潜大泽寒犹蛰，虎踞深林冻不哮。\n掩户且高残腊枕，漆瓢腰系万年梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45219,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"糁粉轻飞二月高，扑空如涌海云涛。\n瑕销白璧全欺赵，色儗麻衣却笑曹。\n不薄青萝凝夏谷，定飘纨扇湿春袍。\n暖堂何似寒岩迥，夜夜风檐映玉毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45220,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"浩荡乾坤平布泽，霏微物象自婆娑。\n芦边立鹤朝曦乱，树里藏鸦夜色多。\n入地定能销碧血，弥天已见倒银河。\n南洲到海犹炎热，坐对泠然发浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45221,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"飘摇缟带总随车，隔绝门庭入径斜。\n透隙却疑搜鼠兔，翻空真似搅龙蛇。\n池中有水偏投影，石上无根亦著花。\n瑰屑不堪寒到眼，纵横难掩碧笼纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45222,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"白霓远近启山堂，欲濯尘氛净上方。\n江浪到天应浸日，琼花著地不闻香。\n千峰倒影入寒瓣，万屋平漫汎夕阳。\n借问年华真个晚，细看春色动遐荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45223,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"云外何因见素情，玉尘风满澹然生。\n寒弦人向深堂调，冻屐谁同傍石行。\n望遥天末山应在，踏近溪边水更清。\n胜事大都成寂寞，兔园空有惠连名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45224,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"白练千条入镜清，轻繁欲向夜窗听。\n凭高且逊尖峰出，就下还寻绝壑停。\n华表鹤翎迷旧郭，丰城龙剑拟新硎。\n攒天一倍临风急，却似彷徨广漠庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45225,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"濛濛万象独凭陵，何物光芒积素凝。\n面目冷然遗草泽，肝肠如见托崚嶒。\n若为热处偏成水，不耐寒多竟作冰。\n自是野人茅舍稳，断桥孤岫一枝藤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45226,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"腊穷泉涸绝溪流，河海云生杲日收。\n一夜似风吹败叶，五更疑月满层楼。\n却回寒燄荣幽桂，岂为凋林感暮秋。\n遇物沦形归大冶，高低平汎曲江头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45227,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"重轮掩抑昼沈沈，顾影难为薄曙襟。\n世上相寻皆桂苑，人间何处有山阴。\n去留不是迷源客，深浅谁论将策心。\n看岳共惊云势涌，低空不觉夜堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45228,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"委积徘徊散薄昙，先春有信到江南。\n常行浅砌犹疑别，欲过前山秖自谙。\n当昼连烟昏远树，无灯通夕晓寒龛。\n但知掩日韬霞意，始觉幽晖万景含。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45229,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"万丈烟波扑钜炎，名模镕尽绝廉纤。\n无端虚室能生白，谁向空中儗撒盐。\n芳洁逾惭高士爱，严寒不畏世人嫌。\n一从凋落黄花后，夜夜峰头写素缣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"谁鞭天外白珂衔，势尽云驹万里帆。\n欲涌波涛翻日月，不留苍翠覆松杉。\n食馀药岭千牛草，寒有青州一布衫。\n莫笑繁丝倚枯木，衰颜穷望上江帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"细看重云里，分明不是空。\n夕寒光独远，凭化委长风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"春色在寥廓，沈烟蘸玉容。\n缟衣轻似舞，乘夜上高峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"爱松埋鹤影，背月照寒窗。\n最是无人处，生憎嘷夜尨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"玉尘散林薄，半上古松枝。\n枝压愁将折，尘宵曾几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"千峰一夜白，先照野人扉。\n似月望高树，溰溰湿衲衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"皎洁侵寒陌，雰霏二月初。\n梨花香未散，随影落吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"因风消蜡炬，无影落澄湖。\n寒热一时尽，清辉何处殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"沨沨连夜动，起舞似闻鸡。\n冰合知寒极，琼花踏作泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"白发镜中落，真同近暮怀。\n但知寒色迥，随处得生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"云里望何极，纷纷扑素埃。\n江山同一色，不见雁飞回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"云暗非关暮，花飘岂是春。\n晴光应十丈，不为住山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"濯濯霓裳湿，何人倚白云。\n莫将云里影，空向陌头分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"浩渺疑空劫，霏微向暮原。\n思归归不得，洞口已迷源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"严威生大漠，万甲拥云寒。\n何处刀砧急，朦胧向夕攒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"落树乌成白，催人鬓欲斑。\n轻质何曾定，浮沈烟雨间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"迢递长征路，徬徨欲曙天。\n最怜清素影，扑落马蹄前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二箫","author":"释函是","text":"山光不是晓，半夜过危桥。\n一似闻生客，千峰失寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"狂吟月下客，门外任推敲。\n深夜寒侵榻，谁怜树上巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"鸟绝山雾起，日沈云影高。\n微风吹玉屑，不上懒瓒袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"三声溪路绝，一壑同云多。\n寒光幽处近，形影托青萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"阶砌叶初上，云山路转赊。\n扫门残影乱，千里望贫家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"枯根覆已尽，残夜滴寒塘。\n人在空山里，山空人影长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"日落山路合，林寒霁色明。\n梁园人尽醉，那识此时情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"带寒汲远涧，片片落云瓶。\n水冻还成片，何劳烟雾停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"阴风吹白羽，皎皎云中澄。\n谁谓终非水，人言不是冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"终岁满林白，重烟隔上头。\n定教寒里见，不遣入春流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"琼花散丹石，掩映临江阴。\n谁知枯落后，更有白云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"倚树繁衣袖，流光向夕含。\n何人能到此，拨火共痴憨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"不分光浮地，还函明镜奁。\n寒辉殊未灭，春色梦中兼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"带雨潇潇下，江寒落远帆。\n峰头一回望，望久没松杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"洒尽平原万里空，横江沙捲马头风。\n寒云已没斜西照，更勒金羁却向东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"欲向冰霜慕远踪，蓝关何惜马蹄封。\n已甘朽骨埋江瘴，犹恨秦云千万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]